{"id":"8ed8a780d077dd76","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-TB-completeness.md","title":"TB中真理原子的可证性恰随PA定理","display":"thm-TB-completeness — TB中真理原子的可证性恰随PA定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-TB-completeness","aliases":["91-thm-TB-completeness"],"display":"thm-TB-completeness — TB中真理原子的可证性恰随PA定理","depends_on":["[[91-df-TB]]","[[91-df-conservative-truth]]","[[91-thm-typed-conservative]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-TB-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-TB-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-TB-completeness — TB中真理原子的可证性恰随PA定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6018cc1b13710826\" href=\"?note=6018cc1b13710826\" title=\"91-df-TB\">91-df-TB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4a1d989a5f615933\" href=\"?note=4a1d989a5f615933\" title=\"91-df-conservative-truth\">91-df-conservative-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7e76f1ecb9ab7743\" href=\"?note=7e76f1ecb9ab7743\" title=\"91-thm-typed-conservative\">91-thm-typed-conservative</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-TB-completeness-—-TB-中真理原子的可证性恰随-PA-定理\">thm-TB-completeness — TB 中真理原子的可证性恰随 PA 定理</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB}\">\\(\\mathrm{TB}\\)</span> (PA 加基础闭句去引号模式)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (Peano 算术)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (算术句子集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\operatorname{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> (TB 对 PA 保守)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}TB\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{TB}\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\bigr)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi\\bigr)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}TB\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{TB}\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\bigr)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi\\bigr)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 PA 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>，TB 继承该证明并由去引号双条件推出\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span>。反之，若 TB 证明该真理原子，T-out\n给出 TB 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>，保守性再给出 PA 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>这不是语义完备性。PA 有真的不可证算术句，TB 对算术又保守，所以 TB\n既不能证明所有真算术句的真理原子，也不能判定每个算术句。文件名中的\n“completeness”只能理解为上述相对于 PA 可证性的精确对应。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-TB-completeness-—-TB-中真理原子的可证性恰随-PA-定理","text":"thm-TB-completeness — TB 中真理原子的可证性恰随 PA 定理","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-TB","status":"resolved","id":"6018cc1b13710826","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-TB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-conservative-truth","status":"resolved","id":"4a1d989a5f615933","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-conservative-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-typed-conservative","status":"resolved","id":"7e76f1ecb9ab7743","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-typed-conservative]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}TB\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{TB}\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\bigr)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi\\bigr)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1418,"backlinks":[{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-129","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-